{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require CCTV coverage around all parks & playgrounds to help protect children",
        "additional_details": "Cameras could help protect children, establish their movements if they go missing, provide vital evidence to police and potentially help prevent further tragedies. Children deserve to feel safe in the places where they play.",
        "background": "We believe that tragedies involving children highlight the need for better safety measures. Require CCTV in and around parks, playgrounds and nearby areas. This could help protect children, trace their movements and assist police in emergencies.",
